# Git

Elise performs every Git write. Agents never run `git commit`, `git push`, `git add` (unless she asked to
stage in that same message), nor amend, rebase, reset, force-push, or `--no-verify`.

Remote: `github.com/dekpo/AssistantCabinetAI`, **private**. Default branch `main`.

After a useful change, **propose in English** and **paste the full commands**, ready to run, one per line,
not just a branch name. Template:

```text
git status
git checkout -b feat/example-topic
git add path/file1 path/file2
git commit -m "feat: short subject in english"
git status
```

One branch per change: `feat|fix|docs|chore/<short-topic>`. Conventional Commit subject, 72 characters or
fewer. Do not mix unrelated changes in one commit; give a stray one-line fix its own branch off `main`.

Never commit secrets, patient names, `.env`, `data/`, `backups/`, or model weights. Policy:
`CONTRIBUTING.md`. Private working notes live in `docs/private/` and are not versioned.
